# Level 6 -> Level 7

# Objective:
Retrieve the password for bandit7 stored in a file somewhere on the server that is owned by user bandit7, owned by group bandit6, and exactly 33 bytes in size.

# breakdown:
Searching the entire filesystem from the root directory / requires matching user ownership (-user bandit7), group ownership (-group bandit6), and size (-size 33c) simultaneously.
 Appending 2>/dev/null redirects error streams to suppress "Permission denied" noise from restricted system folders.

Command:

find / -user bandit7 -group bandit6 -size 33c 2>/dev/null
cat /var/lib/dpkg/info/bandit7.password
